<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Puerto Rico highway bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Puerto Rico highway bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Tuesday it qualified for secondary market insurance Puerto Rico Highway and Transportation highway revenue bonds maturing through 2036.</p>
<p>Derivatives and floating-rate securities are not eligible, MBIA said. Capacity is limited and available on a first-come, first-served basis. For more information, call 800-MBIA-NOW.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
